<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Registrasi Tamu — Irsyaadul & Refalina</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@300;400;600&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2"></script>
<style>
  .cover { display: none !important; }
  body { background-color: var(--bg-cream); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 100vh; padding: 20px; }
  .checkin-container { width: 100%; max-width: 420px; padding: 40px 30px; background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.02); position: relative; z-index: 10; }
  .checkin-title { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 2.2rem; color: var(--gold-dark); text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 400; }
  .checkin-sub { text-align: center; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 30px; font-weight: 300; }
  .rsvp-form input, .rsvp-form textarea, .rsvp-form select { background: var(--bg-cream); }
  .rsvp-form input:focus, .rsvp-form textarea:focus { background: #fff; }
  .msg { text-align: center; margin-top: 15px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--gold-dark); font-weight: 500;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="checkin-container">
  <h2 class="checkin-title">Registrasi Tamu</h2>
  <p class="checkin-sub">Silakan isi data kehadiran aktual di lokasi acara.</p>

  <form id="checkinForm" class="rsvp-form">
    <label>Nama Tamu / Perwakilan
      <input id="ciNama" type="text" required maxlength="60" placeholder="Nama yang hadir saat ini">
    </label>
    
    <label>Jumlah Pax (Aktual yang Hadir)
      <input id="ciPax" type="number" min="1" value="1" required max="20">
    </label>
    
    <label>Doa / Ucapan (Opsional)
      <textarea id="ciDoa" rows="2" maxlength="200" placeholder="Tulis doa untuk mempelai..."></textarea>
    </label>
    
    <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Konfirmasi Kehadiran</button>
    <p id="ciMsg" class="msg"></p>
  </form>
</div>
<script src="supabase.js"></script>
<script src="checkin.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
